악몽을 지키는 파수꾼 2 — 반딧불의 밤 · 2.5D Pixel Art (made with the Lemo-Opuscar style library)

Picture
- All imagery is generated by code in this folder: three.js scenes built from boxes and cylinders, pixel textures and
  pixel characters drawn procedurally per pixel (chars.js: 노을, 하루, the moths), sets in town.js and tower.js.
  No photos, no 3D asset packs, no AI-generated images. Story, characters and places are original.
- Engine pieces copied from the library's 2.5D Pixel Art style (styles/hd-2d/demo: px.js, kit.js, fx.js, post_ts.js;
  ui.js adapted), MIT licence (Lemo-Opuscar LICENSE). three.js r170 (MIT).

Music
- Original score composed and synthesized in music/score.py (harp and pizzicato bass by physical modelling with the
  library's core/audio/pluck.py; celesta, strings, choir, recorder, timpani and hand drum synthesized with numpy).
  No samples, no recordings.

Voices
- Google Cloud Text-to-Speech, Chirp 3: HD voices (ko-KR-Chirp3-HD-Algenib: narrator; ko-KR-Chirp3-HD-Leda: 하루),
  generated by tools/tts_google.py under the user's Google Cloud account and its terms.
- 노을 (the old keeper): Fish Audio, community voice model "걸걸한 할머니" (id 1d90ba56b4274ff8ab7bbaf7f7b7f8a8), free model
  s2.1-pro-free, under the user's Fish Audio account and its terms (chosen by the user, 2026-11-18).
- Speech check: faster-whisper small (MIT), via the library's core/tts/asr_check.py.

Sound effects and ambience
- Synthesized in mix.py with the library's core/audio/sfx.py (noise, filters, envelopes) and numpy. No recorded samples.

